<section class="section"><div class="container contact-grid"><aside class="contact-info"><div class="eyebrow">DIRECT CONTACT</div><h2>Falcon Sales</h2><p class="contact-person">Arslan Attari<br><span>Sales</span></p><a href="tel:+923124604644">0312 4604644</a><a href="tel:+923074242189">0307 4242189</a><a href="tel:+923194764644">0319 4764644</a><a href="mailto:info@falcondrones.pk">info@falcondrones.pk</a><div class="contact-address">Chungi Phatak Faisal Park<br>Sheikhupura, Pakistan</div></aside><div class="form-shell" id="quote"><div class="eyebrow">01 / YOUR REQUIREMENT</div><h2>Get a quote</h2><p>Give us enough detail to understand the mission. We will get back to you directly.</p><form onsubmit="submitQuote(event)"><div class="formgrid"><div class="field"><label>Your name *</label><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div><div class="field"><label>Phone *</label><input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email *</label><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div><div class="field"><label>Drone / service</label><select name="drone"><option>General Inquiry</option><% drones.forEach(d=>{ %><option><%= d.name %></option><% }) %><option>Custom UAV</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Requirements</label><textarea name="message" placeholder="Site size, panel type, cleaning frequency, payload, flight time or anything else that matters..."></textarea></div></div><button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Send request <span>↗</span></button><div class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div></form></div></div></section>
